# Omni Spring Library N Service
A simple library and service collection. Licenses are different for each project.

# Alpha 1.0
Previously there were a lot of stuff, but through some deleting (removing lots of useless projects that are just toys, including a quite old aged project: OSP), now only left with 2 projects: OSFTP and OSA.
OSFTP is a light-weight FTP client library. Used by OSA to storing user avatars.
OSA is a simple authorization and user information database server. Implement to start.